# ArrowDown past the last link of a dialog over a dimmed page stays put: it scrolled the page behind the backdrop 300px a press (The Independent's membership offer).
pages/dialog-over-dimmed-page.html
key:ArrowDown
key:ArrowDown*3
expect:css=#login
key:ArrowDown*2
expect:css=#login
eval:(() => { if (scrollY) throw new Error('the page behind scrolled to ' + scrollY); return scrollY; })()
